nisse-avatars

The gnome pictures, the picture of two gnomes on the phone and the nisse logo are nisse's own art, GPL-2.0-or-later (see
the LICENSE of the nisse repository).

nisse-loves-kde.svg (installed over fedora-loves-kde.svg) is a derived work of fedora-loves-kde.svg from plasma-welcome-fedora
6.3.4-3 (https://pagure.io/fedora-kde/plasma-welcome-fedora). In the derived picture the left logo is the nisse logo in the
shape of the original's left logo, and the heart and the KDE logo are the original's shapes recoloured to one color. The package
licence of plasma-welcome-fedora is (GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only) AND CC-BY-SA-4.0; which of them covers this picture is not
recorded in the package, so the derived picture is distributed under CC-BY-SA-4.0 (text in CC-BY-SA-4.0), the cautious choice,
until upstream confirms. The KDE logo is KDE's.
